=09=09=09=09=09=09=09<br><br>


For the second time in a row, I was forced to impose on the woman with whom=
 I carpooled to our children's soccer practices.
<br><br>
I phoned and explained that my husband had the car again, so I wouldn't be =
able to take my turn.  A few minutes before she was due to pick up my son, =
my husband showed up.  Since it was too late for me to call and say I could=
 drive after all, I asked my husband to hide the car in the garage and to s=
tay inside.  I also explained to my son that he shouldn't mention anything =
about his father's whereabouts.
<br><br>
Unfortunately, my husband forgot and was in front of our house chatting wit=
h a friend when my carpool partner arrived.  When my son returned from prac=
tice, I asked him if she had noticed.
<br><br>
"Yes," he replied, "she asked me which of the two men in front of the house=
 was my father.  But don't worry.  I told her I didn't know."

